# Both images (Dockerfile: agent + web UI, relay/Dockerfile: relay) are built
# from the repository root. Only what they copy is sent as build context:
# everything else (docs, website, e2e, fastlane, vendor/bundle, screenshot
# rigs) stays out, so the context is small and nothing local leaks in.
*
!protocol
!agent
!app
!relay

# Inside those: local installs, build output and the native projects.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
agent/bundle
app/ios
app/android
relay/cloudflare
